{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんみさみさー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ〜お風呂で半身浴しよったら半分寝かけてた〜(´Д` )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぶないあぶないっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/bearing.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもたくさんのコメント本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのブログに書いてるように、とまと・さゆにゃんの誕生日をみんなでレッスンの後にお祝いしたよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きいケーキはいつも３分も持たんで綺麗になくなるよ！\n毎回 せいらりんせいたんのＷせいらは食い付きがはんぱないの(｀_´)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言いつつみさも、とまと達の横で最前列でしっかり食べましたよ(･∀･)えへ\nやっぱみんなケーキ大好きよね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、とまと・さゆにゃん 本当におめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の二人の一年も 素敵な一年になりますように！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にしても、みさ、考えさせられことがいっぱいです(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方から上京してきたメンバーは、こんなにも早く親元を離れるなんて思ってもなかったよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親元を離れてから親の有り難みや 家族・友達の存在がどれだけのものだったかっていうのがすっごくすっごく分かるし本当に感謝しかないよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは美彩も同じだけど とまと・さゆにゃん含む他の地方メンバーは みんなほとんど美彩よりも年下だし まだまだ親にももっといっぱい甘えたかっただろうに 弱音をはかず本当に毎日学校にレッスンにお仕事に頑張ってて凄いなぁって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美彩は年上チームだし もう少し余裕も持てるようになって 頑張っていかなきゃな！ってみんなを見ていていつも思うし いい意味で考えさせられるよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう思わせてくれたメンバーに感謝やね＊ﾟ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもみんなで助け合って頑張ってこうね！！！！\nもちろんみなさんも(*^^*)\n私たちのこと、よろしくお願いします！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっそして今日はキムチ鍋を作ったよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でね、仕上げに最後にマロニー?春雨を入れたんだけど しばらくして鍋あけたら春雨がうどん並に膨らんでてたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでなんよ。\nみさとしたことが！！！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と同時にショックー°･(ノД`)･°･\nせっかく完璧"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/good.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に作ったのにさ〜！！泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春雨が汁を吸いすぎて…というより、完璧に量を入れすぎたようです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど大丈夫やったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味は(´･ω･｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水を増やして キムチ鍋の元も増量して おいしくペロッときました！笑\n鍋開けた瞬間はもうだめかと思ったけどよかった〜(´Д` )♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなは、鍋のあとは 雑炊派？うどんやラーメン派？\nまだ余ってるからどう食べようか迷い中っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/smile.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また時間があったら色々自分で作ろっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/16/img_7349_2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではみさみさそろそろ寝ます。\n明日は金曜日だし、みんな頑張ろうね(=゜ω゜)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐっばーい！"}],"source":"archive"}